      "name": "Miyakojima City",
      "description": "The paradise island city renowned for 'Miyako Blue' sea clarity, long ocean bridges to satellite islands, white powdery sand beaches, and sea turtle snorkeling.",
      "highlights": [
        "Relax at 7km long Yonaha Maehama Beach, rated among Asia's best",
        "Drive the magnificent 3,540m Irabu Bridge over open ocean waters",
        "Snorkel with wild sea turtles at Shigira and Imgya marine parks"
      ],
      "reservationInfo": "City hub access free.",
      "parkingInfo": "Free parking at almost all beaches and bridge view plazas.",
      "openingHours": "24/7 island access."
